# VeltOS desktop: KDE Plasma 6 built from a minimal base plus a short list
# of everyday applications, instead of the much larger task-kde-desktop
# selection. See docs/dev/architecture.md. The kde-plasma-desktop and
# kde-baseapps metapackages are spelled out (minus Dolphin and Konqueror):
# kde-baseapps depends on Dolphin, and VeltOS has one file manager, File
# Explorer (Debian 13: kde-plasma-desktop 5:162).
veltos-desktop
veltos-settings
# Administrator password prompt in the layout of Windows 11's User Account
# Control (polkit agent); KDE's agent service is masked by it.
veltos-auth

plasma-desktop
plasma-workspace
udisks2
upower
kdialog
kde-inotify-survey
kwin-x11
libpam-fprintd
webext-plasma-browser-integration
xserver-xorg
sddm
sddm-theme-breeze
plasma-nm
plasma-pa
bluedevil
powerdevil
# AC/battery-aware system power profiles (VeltOS selects them from Quick
# Settings; performance is offered only on hardware that supports it).
power-profiles-daemon
kscreen
kinfocenter
systemsettings
plasma-systemmonitor
xdg-desktop-portal-kde
# File dialogs in the Windows 11 layout for every program: Qt programs reach
# the portal through this platform theme (QT_QPA_PLATFORMTHEME in
# veltos-session.sh); veltos-explorer is the portal's file chooser backend.
# Verified: qt6-xdgdesktopportal-platformtheme 6.8.2+dfsg-9+deb13u2.
qt6-xdgdesktopportal-platformtheme
# mimeinfo.cache next to the applications (update-desktop-database): GTK
# programs and VeltOS Settings' Default apps read it; without it the page
# showed no defaults (live VM, 2026-10-21). Verified: desktop-file-utils 0.28.
desktop-file-utils
# File search index (Settings > Searching files; balooctl6). Off by default
# (veltos-desktop's /etc/xdg/baloofilerc). Verified: baloo6 6.13.0-1.
baloo6

veltos-explorer
veltos-taskmanager
# Disk Management (Windows 11 layout) on UDisks2; KDE Partition Manager is
# no longer in the image (it was pulled in by veltos-settings' Recommends).
veltos-disks
# Graphics Cards: the cards' drivers (NVIDIA's from Debian non-free on request,
# AMD/Intel firmware and Mesa) and properties; also in Settings > Display.
veltos-graphics
veltos-store
# Clock (Windows 11 layout): alarms, timers, stopwatch, world clock.
veltos-clock
# Calendar (Windows 11 layout); its reminders come from veltos-clock's agent.
veltos-calendar
# Weather (Windows 11 layout) on Open-Meteo's open data (no key).
veltos-weather
# Maps (Windows 11 layout) on the public Google Maps site; location is opt-in.
veltos-maps
# VeltOS AI: the assistant pane (Windows + C) with the user's own API key.
veltos-ai
veltos-snip
veltos-calculator
veltos-camera
konsole
# Notepad (Windows 11 layout) replaces KWrite.
veltos-notepad
# Archive (WinRAR's layout) replaces KDE's Ark. 7zip-rar (Debian non-free,
# RARLAB's unRAR code) lets 7-Zip open every RAR version.
veltos-archive
7zip-rar
# Photos (Windows 11 layout) replaces Gwenview.
veltos-photos
# Media Player (Windows 11 layout) for music and videos.
veltos-media
# PDF Reader (modern reader layout) replaces Okular.
veltos-pdf
# Office: LibreOffice word processor, spreadsheet and presentation set up
# for Windows users (veltos-office), with its Turkish interface.
veltos-office
libreoffice-l10n-tr
kde-spectacle
firefox-esr
firefox-esr-l10n-tr
# VeltOS Mail: e-mail in the layout of Windows 11's new Outlook (its own
# app since 2026-10-23; Thunderbird is no longer in the image).
veltos-mail

pipewire-audio

fonts-noto-core
# Noto's UI fonts and Chinese/Japanese/Korean in their regular and bold
# weights, named here because the "fonts-noto" bundle that brought them is
# left out (veltos-lean.pref.chroot: its extra weights took 113 MB of the ISO).
fonts-noto-ui-core
fonts-noto-cjk
# Cascadia Mono: the terminal font of Windows Terminal (VeltOS terminal profile).
fonts-cascadia-code
fonts-noto-color-emoji
fonts-liberation
